msgid "Quantum optimization {#quantum-optimization}"
msgstr "Quantum optimization {#quantum-optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum optimization explores how quantum computing can be used to solve optimization problems, where the goal is to find the best, or a good, solution among many possible alternatives (often under a set of constraints). Applications of this field include logistics and scheduling, portfolio optimization, and protein folding.\n"
"Quantum optimization approaches include quantum approximate optimization algorithms (QAOA) and other hybrid quantum-classical methods that combine quantum processors with classical optimization techniques. Although quantum computing has the potential to augment our ability to solve optimization problems, identifying practical performance benefits over classical methods remains an active area of research.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tinutuklas ng quantum optimization kung paano magagamit ang quantum computing para lutasin ang mga optimization problem, kung saan ang layunin ay hanapin ang pinakamahusay, o isang mahusay, na solusyon sa maraming posibleng alternatibo (madalas ay may mga kondisyon o constraint). Kasama sa mga aplikasyon ng larangang ito ang logistics at scheduling, portfolio optimization, at protein folding.\n"
"Kasama sa mga pamamaraan ng quantum optimization ang mga quantum approximate optimization algorithm (QAOA) at iba pang hybrid na quantum-classical na pamamaraan na pinagsasama ang mga quantum processor at classical na optimization technique. Bagaman may potensyal ang quantum computing na palakasin ang kakayahan nating lutasin ang mga optimization problem, nananatiling aktibong larangan ng pananaliksik ang pagtukoy ng mga praktikal na benepisyo sa performance kumpara sa mga classical na pamamaraan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Solving an optimization problem on a quantum computer generally involves two stages. First, formulate the problem, (for example, as a quadratic unconstrained binary optimization (QUBO) problem, a higher-order binary optimization (HUBO) problem, or a problem with explicit constraints), and map that formulation into quantum operators and circuits. Second, run the resulting circuit on quantum hardware and interpret the measurement results as a candidate solution. The tools on this page support these two stages: the mapping tool helps you move from a problem definition to a quantum-ready representation, and the application functions combine mapping, hardware execution, and classical post-processing into a single managed workflow.\n"
msgstr "Ang paglutas ng optimization problem sa quantum computer ay karaniwang may dalawang yugto. Una, buuin ang pormulasyon ng problema (halimbawa, bilang quadratic unconstrained binary optimization (QUBO) problem, higher-order binary optimization (HUBO) problem, o problemang may tahasang constraint), at i-map ang pormulasyong iyon sa mga quantum operator at circuit. Pangalawa, patakbuhin ang nagresultang circuit sa quantum hardware at bigyang-kahulugan ang mga resulta ng pagsukat bilang kandidatong solusyon. Sinusuportahan ng mga tool sa pahinang ito ang dalawang yugtong ito: tinutulungan ka ng mapping tool na lumipat mula sa depinisyon ng problema tungo sa representasyong handa para sa quantum, at pinagsasama ng mga application function ang mapping, pagpapatakbo sa hardware, at classical na post-processing sa iisang managed workflow.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mapping tools {#mapping-tools}"
msgstr "Mga mapping tool {#mapping-tools}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This capability specializes in mapping domain problems into quantum operators and circuits for execution on a quantum computer. Use it to formulate an optimization problem as a binary model, convert that model between representations, and validate it against classical solvers before running on quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr "Dalubhasa ang kakayahang ito sa pag-map ng mga domain problem tungo sa mga quantum operator at circuit para patakbuhin sa quantum computer. Gamitin ito para bumuo ng optimization problem bilang binary model, i-convert ang model na iyon sa pagitan ng mga representasyon, at i-validate ito laban sa mga classical solver bago patakbuhin sa quantum hardware.\n"

