msgid "Application functions for optimization {#application-functions-for-optimization}"
msgstr "Mga application function para sa optimization {#application-functions-for-optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following quantum functions package the full optimization workflow, from problem mapping through hardware execution and post-processing, behind a managed interface. Rather than building and tuning your own circuits, you provide a problem definition, such as an objective function, a graph, or an industry-specific input like asset price data, and the function returns an optimized solution. These functions address optimization problems across domains, including unconstrained and constrained binary optimization, portfolio rebalancing in finance, and resource allocation problems defined on graphs.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakete ng mga sumusunod na quantum function ang buong optimization workflow, mula sa problem mapping hanggang sa pagpapatakbo sa hardware at post-processing, sa likod ng isang managed interface. Sa halip na bumuo at mag-tune ng sarili mong mga circuit, magbibigay ka ng depinisyon ng problema, tulad ng objective function, graph, o input na partikular sa industriya gaya ng data ng presyo ng asset, at ibabalik ng function ang isang na-optimize na solusyon. Tinutugunan ng mga function na ito ang mga optimization problem sa iba't ibang domain, kasama ang unconstrained at constrained na binary optimization, portfolio rebalancing sa finance, at mga problema sa resource allocation na tinukoy sa mga graph.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
